      {
        "body": "Historical observation from the completed queue investigation: backlog grew during the evening peak and cleared overnight while consumer count was fixed. The investigation concluded with the decision to repartition by a higher-cardinality key and keep autoscaling off. The user confirmed the queue work is done on 2026-10-20.",
