      {
        "body": "Tried scaling consumers with the backlog. It helped briefly, then made\nthings worse: more consumers meant more contention on the same partition.\n",
        "created_secs": 1792501838.0,
        "degree": 2,
        "id": "01a1596f-7371-7f32-8ab2-6c4e1a6ae8dc",
        "initiatives": [
