      {
        "body": "Repartition by a higher-cardinality key and keep autoscaling off: the partition key concentrated evening traffic on one partition, and adding consumers increased contention after a brief improvement. This decision follows the partition diagnosis, scaling trial and original backlog observation. The user confirmed queue work is done on 2026-10-20.",
