    {
      "body": "State: The user confirmed on 2026-10-20 that the queue work is done. The settled direction is to repartition by the higher-cardinality key; autoscaling stays off for this queue.\nReasoning: Evening traffic concentrated on one partition. Scaling consumers helped briefly, then increased contention on that partition. The partition key was the cause identified in the investigation.\nBlockers: No queue-specific open tasks or blockers are recorded. Separate project notes about other pending work are not closed by this update.\nNext concrete step: Hand over the completed queue work and the saved decision with its investigation history. No further queue implementation task was supplied. Deployment or validation details were not supplied.",
